(window.BOOK_MODULES = window.BOOK_MODULES || {})[15] = {"n": 15, "title": "Nouns with Restricted Declension", "ar": "غَيْرُ المُنْصَرِفِ", "lessons": [{"key": "0", "title": "Introduction", "short": "Introduction", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L0-s1\">Before you begin</h2><p>A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحة</span> does not always mean <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span>. In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مررتُ بأحمدَ</span></b>, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحمد</span> is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور بالباء، وعلامة جرّه الفتحة نيابةً عن الكسرة</span></b>. This module teaches when that happens, why some <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أسماء</span> behave differently, and when <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسرة</span> returns.</p><p>Recall <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل، معمول، فاعل، مفعول به، حرف جر، مضاف، مضاف إليه، نعت، منعوت، معرب، مبني، إعراب لفظي، إعراب تقديري</span></b>. Identify the role before the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة</span>.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L0-s2\">The small amount of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صرف</span> needed here</h2><ul><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وزن</span></b> compares a word’s form with a pattern: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحمر</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أفعل؛ غضبان</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعلان؛ مساجد</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفاعل</span></b>. Match the internal pattern, not merely the final letters.</li><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف أصلي / حرف زائد</span></b> distinguishes a letter belonging to the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أصل</span> from an added letter. The distinction may require knowing the word’s formation; spelling alone is not always enough.</li><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">متحرّك / ساكن</span></b> describes whether a letter carries a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حركة</span>. A <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شدّة</span></b> represents two letters, the first <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ساكن</span> and the second <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">متحرّك</span>.</li><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عَلَم</span></b> names a particular person or place. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صفة</span></b> here concerns a word’s descriptive formation, not just whether it happens to occupy the role <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت</span> in one <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span>.</li><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مؤنث لفظًا / مؤنث معنىً</span></b> distinguishes a marker in the form from the meaning. A name such as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طلحة</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء</span> even when it names a man.</li></ul><p>Each question or table row has one correct choice. Where <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الصرف والمنع</span> are both valid, follow the treatment named in the question. Later tasks reduce English help and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضبط</span>. Supply endings for connected reading, not <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وقف</span>.</p>", "secs": [{"id": "L0-s1", "title": "Before you begin"}, {"id": "L0-s2", "title": "The small amount of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صرف</span> needed here"}], "items": []}, {"key": "1", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غير المنصرف</span> is still <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرب</span>", "short": "Lesson 1", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L1-s1\">Core rule and terminology</h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غير المنصرف</span></b>, also called <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الممنوع من الصرف</span></b>, ordinarily receives neither <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين</span> nor <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسرة</span>. It has <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمة في الرفع، فتحة في النصب، وفتحة نيابة عن الكسرة في الجر</span></b>. This is the pattern when it has neither <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أل</span> nor <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span>; Lesson 8 explains the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استثناء</span>.</p><p>Here <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الصرف</span></b> means the relevant <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين</span>. Do not confuse <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منع الصرف</span></b> with the whole <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علم الصرف</span>.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Setting</th><th><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصرف</span></th><th><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غير منصرف</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء خالدٌ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء أحمدُ</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيتُ خالدًا</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيتُ أحمدَ</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مررتُ بخالدٍ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مررتُ بأحمدَ</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p>The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العامل</span> still decides <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع، نصب</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر. غير المنصرف</span> changes the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة</span> used for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر</span>, not the relationship itself.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L1-s2\">Recognise the longer terminology</h2><table><thead><tr><th>Expression</th><th>Classification</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم متمكّن أمكن</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرب منصرف</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم متمكّن غير أمكن</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرب غير منصرف</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم غير متمكّن</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غير أمكن</span></b> does not mean <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني</span>. Likewise, absence of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين</span> alone does not establish <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منع الصرف</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكتابِ</span></b> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتابِ خالدٍ</span></b> have no <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين</span> for other reasons.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L1-s3\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مَرَرْتُ بِأَحْمَدَ</span>.</b> <span class=\"gl\">I passed by Ahmad.</span></div><ul><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مررتُ: فعل ماض مبني على السكون لاتصاله بتاء الفاعل؛ التاء ضمير في محل رفع فاعل</span>.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الباء: حرف جر، لا محل له من الإعراب</span>.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحمدَ: اسم مجرور بالباء، وعلامة جرّه الفتحة نيابةً عن الكسرة لأنه غير منصرف</span>. Its cause is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العلمية ووزن الفعل</span>, developed in Lesson 5.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بأحمد: جار ومجرور متعلقان بمررت</span>.</li></ul></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L1-s1", "title": "Core rule and terminology"}, {"id": "L1-s2", "title": "Recognise the longer terminology"}, {"id": "L1-s3", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "1G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Match the role and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة</span> of <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحمد</span></b>, without <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أل</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء</span> requires <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل؛ رأيت</span> requires <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به؛ الباء</span> gives <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر. أحمد</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرب غير منصرف</span>, so <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر</span> uses <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحة</span> when neither <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أل</span> nor <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span> is present.</p>", "group": "1G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء أحمدُ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مبني على الضم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع بالضمة بلا تنوين</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيت أحمدَ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مجرور بالفتحة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب بالفتحة بلا تنوين</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مررت بأحمدَ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب بالفتحة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على الفتح</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مجرور بالفتحة نيابة عن الكسرة</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "1G-2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Match the terminology.", "sol": "<p>The first two are both <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرب</span>. Only <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غير متمكّن</span> names the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني</span> category in this classification.</p>", "group": "1G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">متمكّن أمكن</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرب منصرف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرب غير منصرف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">متمكّن غير أمكن</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرب غير منصرف</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غير متمكّن</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصرف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غير منصرف معرب</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "1I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Complete <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تحدّثتُ معَ أحمد<span class=\"blank\"></span></span></b>. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحمد</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>, with no <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أل</span> and no following <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span> of its own.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معَ</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحمدَ مضاف إليه</span>. The role requires <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غير المنصرف</span> uses <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحة</span> for that <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر</span> in this setting.</p>", "group": "1I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحمدًا: مفعول به</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحمدَ: مضاف إليه مجرور بالفتحة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحمدِ</span>: every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span> must end in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسرة</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "1I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Correct: “<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحمدَ</span> has the same ending after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رأيت</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">باء</span>, so it must be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني</span>.”", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء أحمدُ</span> displays <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رفع. رأيت أحمدَ</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بأحمدَ</span> have different <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span> despite the shared <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحة</span>. Equality of one visible ending is not proof of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء</span>.</p>", "group": "1I|Independent", "opts": ["Correct: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحمد</span> is always <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على الفتح</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحمد</span> cannot occur after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span>.", "It is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرب</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحة</span> can mark either <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر</span> here."], "ans": 2}, {"id": "1R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مررتُ بالكتابِ</span></b>, why is absence of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين</span> insufficient evidence for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منع الصرف</span>?", "sol": "<p>Check the construction before classifying. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أل</span> removes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين</span> from ordinary <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصرف أسماء</span> too.</p>", "group": "1R|Review", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكتاب</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب</span> because it lacks <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين</span>.", "Every word with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أل</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أل</span> prevents <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الكتاب</span> remains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرورًا بالكسرة</span>."], "ans": 2}, {"id": "1-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غير المنصرف اسم معرب</span>.</b> Which follows?", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الباء</span> governs <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر. منع الصرف</span> changes the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة</span> of that <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر</span> without changing <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحمد</span> into <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني</span> or into a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف</span>.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بأحمدَ: مجرور بالفتحة، لا مبني على الفتح</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بأحمدَ: لا محل له كالحروف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بأحمدَ: منصوب بالباء</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"key": "2", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف التأنيث الزائدة</span>", "short": "Lesson 2", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L2-s1\">One cause sufficient by itself</h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف التأنيث الزائدة</span></b> prevents <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الصرف</span> without needing <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العلمية</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الوصفية</span>. It stands in place of two causes: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقوم مقام السببين</span></b>. It occurs as the fourth letter or later, never as the third.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Form</th><th>Examples</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف التأنيث المقصورة</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ذكرى، كبرى، سلمى، مرضى</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف التأنيث الممدودة</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صحراء، حسناء، علماء، زكريّاء</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مقصورة</span></b> ends in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف</span> without a following <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">همزة</span> in this form; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ممدودة</span></b> has the ending <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ـاء</span>. The rule applies to the stated <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف التأنيث</span>, not automatically to every word ending in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ا، ى</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اء</span>.</p><p>It applies equally to <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الموحّد والجمع، الصفة واسم الذات، والعَلَم</span></b>. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صحراء</span> names a place type; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كبرى</span> describes; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علماء</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جمع</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سلمى</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عَلَم</span>. These differences do not remove <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف التأنيث</span>.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L2-s2\">Do not infer from shape alone</h2><p>The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف</span> of <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هُدًى</span></b> is third, so it is not <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف التأنيث</span>. Its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين</span> is compatible with being <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصرف</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ذِكْرَى</span></b> has the relevant <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف التأنيث</span> and no <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين</span>.</p><p>With final <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف مقصورة</span>, the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامات</span> are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مقدّرة</span> because of <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التعذّر</span></b>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاءت سلمى؛ رأيت سلمى؛ مررت بسلمى</span></b>. The last has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحة مقدّرة نيابةً عن الكسرة</span>. Unchanging pronunciation does not turn <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سلمى</span> into <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني</span>.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L2-s3\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سَافَرْتُ فِي صَحْرَاءَ وَاسِعَةٍ</span>.</b> <span class=\"gl\">I travelled in a wide desert.</span></div><ul><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سافرتُ: فعل ماض، والتاء فاعل</span>.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في: حرف جر</span>.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صحراءَ: اسم مجرور بفي، وعلامة جرّه الفتحة نيابةً عن الكسرة؛ غير منصرف لألف التأنيث الممدودة</span>.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واسعةٍ: نعت مجرور، وعلامة جرّه الكسرة</span>. It follows <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صحراء</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر</span>, not necessarily in the same <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة</span>.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في صحراء: جار ومجرور متعلقان بسافرت</span>.</li></ul></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L2-s1", "title": "One cause sufficient by itself"}, {"id": "L2-s2", "title": "Do not infer from shape alone"}, {"id": "L2-s3", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "2G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Match the relevant ending.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ذكرى</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صحراء</span> have the two qualifying forms. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هدى</span> has a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف</span> in third position and is not included by this cause.</p>", "group": "2G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ذكرى</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف التأنيث المقصورة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء التأنيث</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف التأنيث الممدودة</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صحراء</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب مزجي</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف ثالثة أصلية</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف التأنيث الممدودة</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هدًى</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجموع منتهى الجموع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف تأنيث رابعة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ليست ألفه ألف التأنيث؛ تقع ثالثة</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "2G-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Why does <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علماء</span></b> qualify here even when it is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة</span>?", "sol": "<p>This cause needs neither <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العلمية</span> nor a particular syntactic role. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علماء</span> ends in the qualifying <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف التأنيث الممدودة</span>.</p>", "group": "2G|Guided", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كل نكرة ممنوعة من الصرف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف التأنيث الممدودة تكفي وحدها</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كل جمع غير منصرف بلا شروط</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "2I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Complete <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مررتُ بصحراءَ واسع<span class=\"blank\"></span></span></b>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واسعة</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصرف</span>, so its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر</span> uses <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسرة مع التنوين</span>. It follows <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صحراء</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر</span>, while the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة</span> differs.</p>", "group": "2I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واسعةَ</span>: must copy the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحة</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صحراء</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واسعةٌ: خبر مرفوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">واسعةٍ: نعت مجرور بالكسرة</span>"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "2I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Analyse <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بسلمى</span></b> in the ordinary <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عَلَم</span> use.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سلمى</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف التأنيث المقصورة</span>. The final <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف</span> prevents the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حركة</span> from appearing, so the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحة</span> of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مقدّرة للتعذّر</span>.</p>", "group": "2I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سلمى مجرور بفتحة مقدّرة نيابة عن الكسرة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سلمى منصوب بفتحة ظاهرة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سلمى مبني على السكون</span>"], "ans": 0}, {"id": "2R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Which explains why <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ذكرى</span></b> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحمد</span></b> can both lack <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين</span>?", "sol": "<p>A shared ending behaviour does not require a shared cause. Both are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معربان غير منصرفين</span> in the stated uses.</p>", "group": "2R|Review", "opts": ["Both must be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جمعًا</span>.", "Both must be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبنيان</span>.", "Different qualifying causes: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف التأنيث</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ذكرى</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العلمية ووزن الفعل</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحمد</span>."], "ans": 2}, {"id": "2-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا تقع ألف التأنيث الزائدة إلا رابعةً فصاعدًا</span>.</b> What does this establish about <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هدًى</span></b>?", "sol": "<p>The position test excludes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هدى</span> from this cause. Do not use the visual shape <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ى</span> alone as a classification.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["Its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف</span> prevents <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الصرف</span> automatically.", "Any word ending in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ى</span> must be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني</span>.", "Its third-position <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف</span> is not <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف التأنيث</span>."], "ans": 2}]}, {"key": "3", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجموع منتهى الجموع</span>", "short": "Lesson 3", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L3-s1\">Core rule and pattern</h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجموع منتهى الجموع</span></b>, also called <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الجمع الأقصى</span></b>, is another cause sufficient by itself. Recognise the relevant <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جمع مكسّر</span> by what follows its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف</span>:</p><table><thead><tr><th>Form</th><th>Example</th><th>What follows the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Two letters</td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مَسَاجِد</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ج، د</span></td></tr><tr><td>Two letters represented by <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إدغام</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صَوَافّ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ف، ف</span>, shown by <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شدّة</span></td></tr><tr><td>Three letters, the middle one <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ساكن</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مَصَابِيح</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ب، ي، ح</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ي ساكنة</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p>Common <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أوزان</span> are <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفاعل</span></b> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفاعيل</span></b>. Not every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جمع مكسّر</span> qualifies: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ملائكةٌ</span></b> does not fit these endings. Do not classify by the mere presence of a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف</span> inside a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جمع</span>.</p><p>The patterns are treated as having the force of two causes. Their explanation includes forms resembling a repeated <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جمع</span>, such as <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سوار</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أسورة</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أساور</span></b> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عربيّ</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عرب</span> ← <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أعاريب</span></b>. You do not need to prove two historical steps for every new example; use the structural test.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L3-s2\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَضَأْتُ الغُرْفَةَ بِمَصَابِيحَ</span>.</b> <span class=\"gl\">I lit the room with lamps.</span></div><ul><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أضأتُ: فعل ماض مبني على السكون، والتاء فاعل</span>.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الغرفةَ: مفعول به منصوب بالفتحة</span>.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الباء: حرف جر؛ مصابيحَ: اسم مجرور بالباء، وعلامة جرّه الفتحة نيابةً عن الكسرة لأنه مجموع منتهى الجموع</span>.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بمصابيح: جار ومجرور متعلقان بأضأت</span>.</li></ul><p>Compare <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بمصابيحَ</span></b> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بالكتابِ</span></b>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span> establishes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر</span> in both; the class and construction determine the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة</span>.</p></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L3-s1", "title": "Core rule and pattern"}, {"id": "L3-s2", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "3G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Apply the structural test to the supplied forms.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مساجد</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ج د</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصابيح</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ب ي ح</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ي ساكنة</span>; the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شدّة</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صوافّ</span> represents <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ف ف</span>. Count the underlying letters, not just written shapes.</p>", "group": "3G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مَسَاجِد</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ليس جمعًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بعد الألف ثلاثة أحرف أوسطها متحرّك</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بعد الألف حرفان</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مَصَابِيح</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف التأنيث المقصورة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بعد الألف ثلاثة أحرف أوسطها ساكن</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بعد الألف حرف واحد</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صَوَافّ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بعد الألف حرف واحد فقط</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بعد الألف أربعة أحرف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بعد الألف حرفان مدغمان</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "3G-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Which contrast is correct?", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منتهى الجموع</span> has a particular structure. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ملائكة</span> does not end with the stated two-letter or three-letter pattern after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف</span>.</p>", "group": "3G|Guided", "opts": ["Neither can be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جمعًا</span>.", "Both qualify merely because they contain <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مساجد غير منصرف بمنتهى الجموع؛ ملائكة لا يطابق هذا البناء</span>."], "ans": 2}, {"id": "3I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مَفَاتِيح</span></b> means keys and has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ت، ي، ح</span> after its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف</span>, with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ي ساكنة</span>. Complete <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بحثتُ عن <span class=\"blank\"></span></span></b> without <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أل</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span>.", "sol": "<p>The supplied structure is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منتهى الجموع. عن</span> gives <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر</span>, marked here by <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحة</span> without <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين</span>.</p>", "group": "3I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفاتيحَ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفاتيحٍ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفاتيحًا</span>"], "ans": 0}, {"id": "3I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Correct: “Every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جمع مكسّر</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غير منصرف</span> because it is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جمع</span>.”", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مساجد</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصابيح</span> qualify by their patterns. The label <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جمع مكسّر</span> is broader, as the contrast with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ملائكة</span> shows.</p>", "group": "3I|Independent", "opts": ["Correct: all <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جموع</span> have <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منع الصرف</span>.", "Only <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أعلام</span> can be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غير منصرف</span>.", "The specified <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منتهى الجموع</span> pattern qualifies; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جمع</span> alone is insufficient."], "ans": 2}, {"id": "3R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Why do <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صحراء</span></b> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصابيح</span></b> need no <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العلمية</span> to prevent <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الصرف</span>?", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صحراء</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف التأنيث؛ مصابيح</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منتهى الجموع</span>. Each is independently sufficient, and neither makes the word <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبنيًا</span>.</p>", "group": "3R|Review", "opts": ["Both are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبنيان على الفتح</span>.", "Both secretly function as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أعلام</span> in every use.", "Each has a cause that <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يقوم مقام السببين</span>."], "ans": 2}, {"id": "3-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحرفان بعد الألف قد يكونان مدغمين</span>.</b> Which form illustrates this?", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صوافّ</span> ends with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فّ</span>, representing two <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاء</span> letters in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إدغام. مساجد</span> has two distinct letters, not <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إدغام</span>.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هدًى</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مساجد</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ج</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">د</span> distinct", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صوافّ</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"key": "4", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الصفة</span> and its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شروط</span>", "short": "Lesson 4", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L4-s1\"><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الوصفية</span> alone is not enough</h2><p>A word is not <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غير منصرف</span> merely because it describes something. Three patterns matter here:</p><table><thead><tr><th>Pattern</th><th>Required <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span></th><th>Example and contrast</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أفعل</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غير قابل للتاء؛ أصل في الوصف</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحمر، أدهم؛</span> contrast <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أرمل</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أربع</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعلان</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مؤنثه فعلى، لا فعلانة</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غضبان / غضبى؛</span> contrast <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ندمان / ندمانة</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معدول</span></td><td>A descriptive form altered from its original expression</td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مثنى، ثلاث، رباع</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غير قابل للتاء</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحمر</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حمراء</span> rather than <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحْمَرة</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أرمل</span></b> permits <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أرملة</span>, so it fails this <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أصل في الوصف</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أدهم</span> is originally descriptive; <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أربع</span></b> is originally a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عدد</span> and does not acquire this <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منع</span> merely by being used descriptively. It is not enough to spot <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أ</span> at the beginning.</p><p>For the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعلان</span> contrast, use <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ندمان</span></b> in the sense “a companion,” with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ندمانة</span>. The relevant distinction is its supplied <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مؤنث</span>, not the final <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ان</span> alone.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L4-s2\"><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العدل</span></h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معدول</span></b> means <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عُدل عن صيغته الأصلية</span></b>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مثنى، ثلاث، رباع</span></b> express distribution: two at a time, three at a time, four at a time. Their explanatory originals are <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثنتين ثنتين، ثلاثًا ثلاثًا، أربعًا أربعًا</span></b>. The two causes are <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الوصفية والعدل</span></b>. These forms do not simply add up the numbers.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L4-s3\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مَرَرْتُ بِرَجُلٍ غَضْبَانَ</span>.</b> <span class=\"gl\">I passed by an angry man.</span></div><ul><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مررتُ: فعل ماض، والتاء فاعل</span>.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الباء: حرف جر؛ رجلٍ: اسم مجرور بالكسرة</span>.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غضبانَ: نعت مجرور، وعلامة جرّه الفتحة نيابةً عن الكسرة؛ غير منصرف للوصفية والألف والنون الزائدتين، ومؤنثه غضبى</span>.</li></ul><p>Both <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجل</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غضبان</span> have <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر</span>. Matching a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت</span> to its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منعوت</span> does not require matching the visible <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حركة</span> when the two belong to different classes.</p></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L4-s1", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الوصفية</span> alone is not enough"}, {"id": "L4-s2", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العدل</span>"}, {"id": "L4-s3", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "4G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Match the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span> to the example.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحمر</span> meets the stated <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أفعل شرط</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أرمل</span> permits <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أرملة. غضبان</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غضبى</span>, while the specified <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ندمان</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ندمانة</span>, so the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعلان</span> rule does not apply to it.</p>", "group": "4G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحمر / حمراء</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صفة أفعل تقبل التاء</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صفة أفعل لا تقبل التاء</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علم مركّب</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أرمل / أرملة</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منتهى الجموع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يقبل التاء فلا يمنع بهذا الباب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غير قابل للتاء</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غضبان / غضبى</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صفة فعلان مؤنثها فعلانة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صفة فعلان مؤنثها فعلى</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علم أعجمي</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ندمان / ندمانة</span>: companion", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ممنوع لانتهاء كل اسم بان</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف تأنيث مقصورة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا يحقق شرط فعلى</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "4G-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "What does <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مثنى</span></b> express in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء الطلابُ مثنى</span></b>?", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مثنى</span> is a descriptive distributive form. Its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منع</span> combines <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الوصفية والعدل</span>; it does not simply name a total count.</p>", "group": "4G|Guided", "opts": ["Two at a time; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معدول عن ثنتين ثنتين</span>", "An ordinary <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عَلَم</span> for a student", "Exactly one pair with no distributive meaning"], "ans": 0}, {"id": "4I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أَصْفَر / صَفْرَاء</span></b> means yellow and is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أصليّ في الوصف</span>. Complete <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بقلمٍ <span class=\"blank\"></span></span></b>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أصفر</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الوصفية ووزن أفعل</span> and does not take <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء</span> in its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مؤنث</span>. It is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت مجرور بالفتحة نيابة عن الكسرة</span>, without <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أل</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span>.</p>", "group": "4I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أصفرٌ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أصفرٍ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أصفرَ</span>"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "4I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Why does <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أربع</span></b> fail the taught <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أفعل</span> test, even when used descriptively?", "sol": "<p>Both stated <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شروط</span> matter. Incidental descriptive use does not supply original <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الوصفية</span>.</p>", "group": "4I|Independent", "opts": ["Every four-letter word is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصرف</span>.", "It is originally <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عددًا</span>, not <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أصلًا في الوصف</span>.", "It is necessarily <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على الكسر</span>."], "ans": 1}, {"id": "4R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">برجلٍ غضبانَ</span></b>, how can the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت</span> match its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منعوت</span>?", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التبعية</span> is in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر</span> here. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> classes explain the different <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامات. غضبان</span> qualifies through <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الوصفية والألف والنون</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غضبى</span>.</p>", "group": "4R|Review", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غضبان</span> must become <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غضبانٍ</span> in every use.", "Both are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجروران</span>; the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسرة</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجل</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحة</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غضبان</span>.", "The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نعت</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب</span> and agrees by meaning only."], "ans": 1}, {"id": "4-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مؤنثه فعلى دون فعلانة</span>.</b> Choose the qualifying pair.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غضبان وغضبى</span> meet the exact <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span>. The other pairs do not establish <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعلان/فعلى</span>.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غضبان / غضبى</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ندمان / ندمانة</span> in the supplied sense", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أرمل / أرملة</span> as a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعلان</span> pair"], "ans": 0}]}, {"key": "5", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العَلَم</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وزن الفعل، الألف والنون،</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العدل</span>", "short": "Lesson 5", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L5-s1\">Three combinations</h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العلمية</span></b> alone does not prevent <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الصرف: خالدٌ</span> is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عَلَم</span> and is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصرف</span>. It must combine with another qualifying cause.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Combination</th><th>Examples</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العلمية ووزن الفعل</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحمد، تغلب، يعرب</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العلمية والألف والنون الزائدتان</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عثمان</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العلمية والعدل</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عمر،</span> explained from <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامر</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p>The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وزن الفعل</span> group includes forms associated with <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ماضٍ ثلاثي مجهول</span></b> (<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">دُئِل</span>), <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع ثلاثي معلوم</span></b> (<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحمد، تغلب، يعرب</span>), <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أمر ثلاثي</span></b> (<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إثمد</span>), and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أفعال مزيد فيها</span></b> (<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شبّر، صالحَ</span>). These are examples treated as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أعلام</span> in this setting. A name that resembles a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> is still a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم</span> in its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span>. Keep <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صالحَ</span></b>, on the stated <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> pattern, distinct from an ordinary name <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صالحٌ</span></b> on <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وزن فاعل</span>.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L5-s2\">When the origin is uncertain</h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حسّان</span></b> permits <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الصرف والمنع</span> according to its derivation:</p><ul><li>From <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحُسن</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وزن</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعّال</span></b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">؛ النون أصلية؛</span> use <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الصرف</span>.</li><li>From <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحسّ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وزن</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعلان</span></b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">؛ النون زائدة؛</span> use <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منع الصرف</span>.</li></ul><p>The similar issue of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أصالة وزيادة</span> is also noted for <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شيطان</span></b>. Do not treat a guessed origin as established evidence. Exercises about <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حسّان</span> specify the derivation.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L5-s3\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كَتَبَ عُمَرُ إِلَى عُثْمَانَ</span>.</b> <span class=\"gl\">Umar wrote to Uthman.</span></div><ul><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتب: فعل ماض مبني على الفتح</span>.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عمرُ: فاعل مرفوع بالضمة بلا تنوين؛ غير منصرف للعلمية والعدل</span>.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إلى: حرف جر</span>.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عثمانَ: اسم مجرور بإلى، وعلامة جرّه الفتحة نيابةً عن الكسرة؛ غير منصرف للعلمية والألف والنون الزائدتين</span>.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إلى عثمان: جار ومجرور متعلقان بكتب</span>.</li></ul></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L5-s1", "title": "Three combinations"}, {"id": "L5-s2", "title": "When the origin is uncertain"}, {"id": "L5-s3", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "5G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Match each <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عَلَم</span> to the cause added to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العلمية</span>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحمد</span> has the relevant <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> pattern; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عثمان</span> has added <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف ونون</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عمر</span> is treated as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معدول عن عامر. العلمية</span> is part of each combination.</p>", "group": "5G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحمد</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وزن الفعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التركيب المزجي</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف التأنيث</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عثمان</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منتهى الجموع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الألف والنون الزائدتان</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العدل</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عمر</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء التأنيث</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العجمة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العدل</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "5G-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Treat <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حسّان</span></b> as derived from <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحُسن</span></b>, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وزن فعّال</span>. Complete <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مررتُ بحسّان<span class=\"blank\"></span></span></b>.", "sol": "<p>Under the stated derivation <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">النون أصلية</span>, so this name has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صرف. الباء</span> therefore gives <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسرة مع التنوين: بحسّانٍ</span>.</p>", "group": "5G|Guided", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حسّانُ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حسّانٍ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حسّانَ</span> on the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحسّ</span> derivation"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "5I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Now use <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حسّان</span></b> from <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحسّ</span></b>, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وزن فعلان</span>. Complete <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتبتُ إلى حسّان<span class=\"blank\"></span></span></b>.", "sol": "<p>The stated account makes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الألف والنون زائدتين</span>. Combined with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العلمية</span>, this gives <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منع الصرف</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر بالفتحة</span> after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إلى</span>.</p>", "group": "5I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حسّانَ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حسّانٍ</span> on the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحسن</span> derivation", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حسّانٌ</span>"], "ans": 0}, {"id": "5I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Correct: “<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يعرب</span> in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضر يعربُ</span></b> is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع</span> because its form resembles one.”", "sol": "<p>Form and use are separate tests. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يعرب</span> names the person who arrived, so it is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم علم، فاعل مرفوع بالضمة بلا تنوين</span>.</p>", "group": "5I|Independent", "opts": ["It must be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرفًا لا محل له</span>.", "It is a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عَلَم</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وزن الفعل</span> helps explain <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منع الصرف</span>.", "Correct: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حضر</span> has no <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> here."], "ans": 1}, {"id": "5R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Compare <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء خالدٌ</span></b> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاء عمرُ</span></b>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العلمية</span> alone does not suffice. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالد</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصرف</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عمر</span> qualifies through <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العلمية والعدل</span>.</p>", "group": "5R|Review", "opts": ["Every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عَلَم</span> must lack <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين</span>, so <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">خالدٌ</span> is wrong.", "Both are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل وعَلَم</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عمر</span> additionally has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العدل</span>, so it lacks <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عمر</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني</span> because it lacks <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين</span>."], "ans": 1}, {"id": "5-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جاز الصرف والمنع بحسب التقدير</span>.</b> What makes a single-answer question about <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حسّان</span> unambiguous?", "sol": "<p>The origin determines whether <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">النون</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أصلية</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">زائدة</span>. The question must fix that account before asking for one ending.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["Specifying <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحسن</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحسّ</span> as the derivation", "Ignoring the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span> and both derivations", "Declaring all names ending in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ان</span> identical"], "ans": 0}]}, {"key": "6", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العَلَم المؤنث</span> and recognised alternatives", "short": "Lesson 6", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L6-s1\">Core rule</h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العلمية والتأنيث</span></b> combine in two ways:</p><table><thead><tr><th>Form</th><th>Rule and examples</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مؤنث بالتاء</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاطمة، طلحة: منع الصرف</span> even when <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طلحة</span> names a man</td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مؤنث بالمعنى</span>, without <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منع</span> if <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عجمي (بلخ</span>), more than three letters (<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مريم</span>), or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثلاثي متحرّك الوسط (سَقَر</span>)</td></tr></tbody></table><p>For an Arabic <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثلاثي ساكن الوسط</span> such as <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هند</span></b>, both <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الصرف والمنع</span> are permitted; use <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المنع</span> as the preferred treatment unless a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استفهام</span> specifies <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الصرف</span>. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بهندَ</span></b> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بهندٍ</span></b> therefore represent different valid treatments.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L6-s2\"><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أسماء القبائل والأراضي</span></h2><p>Do not impose one blanket rule on all <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أسماء القبائل</span> or all <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أسماء الأماكن</span>. Their established treatment can reflect <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التأنيث</span></b> or <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التذكير</span></b>:</p><ul><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تميم</span></b> permits <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المنع</span> as a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مؤنث عَلَم</span>, or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الصرف</span> with an understood relationship such as <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بنو تميم</span></b>.</li><li>Examples of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منع</span> among <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">القبائل</span> include <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">باهلة، تغلب، سدوس</span></b>; examples of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صرف</span> include <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثقيف، معدّ</span></b>. The explanation may treat the name as naming a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أم</span> or a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أب</span>.</li><li><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بغداد، خراسان، هجر</span></b> have <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منع</span> in the stated uses, treating the place as <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بقعة</span></b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">؛</span> <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حنين</span></b> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صرف</span>, treating it as <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مكان</span></b>.</li><li>Both treatments occur for <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طوى</span></b>. Learn the recognised usage rather than inventing a universal rule from geography alone.</li></ul><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L6-s3\"><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فَعَالِ</span>: separate <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span> from <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء</span></h2><p>For a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عَلَم</span> such as <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذام</span></b>, the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حجازي</span> treatment uses <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء على الكسر</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذامِ</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تميمي</span> treatment uses <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منع الصرف</span></b>. These are not two ways of writing the same <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جرّ علامة</span>: one is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء</span>, the other <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span>.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L6-s4\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سَلَّمْتُ عَلَى هِنْدَ</span>.</b> Use <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المنع</span>.</p><ul><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سلّمتُ: فعل ماض، والتاء فاعل</span>.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">على: حرف جر؛ هندَ: اسم مجرور بعلى، وعلامة جرّه الفتحة نيابةً عن الكسرة؛ غير منصرف للعلمية والتأنيث</span>.</li></ul><p>With <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الصرف</span>, use <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">على هندٍ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور بالكسرة مع التنوين</span>. With <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">على حذامِ</span></b> under the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حجازي</span> treatment, say <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على الكسر في محل جر</span></b>, not <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور بكسرة ظاهرة</span>.</p></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L6-s1", "title": "Core rule"}, {"id": "L6-s2", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أسماء القبائل والأراضي</span>"}, {"id": "L6-s3", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فَعَالِ</span>: separate <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span> from <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء</span>"}, {"id": "L6-s4", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "6G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Match the reason or treatment.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طلحة</span> qualifies through the form’s <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العلمية</span>, regardless of a male referent. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مريم</span> meets the length <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط. هند</span> has a recognised choice rather than a single obligatory treatment.</p>", "group": "6G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">طلحة</span>, naming a man", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علم مؤنث بالتاء؛ يمنع من الصرف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصرف لأن المسمّى رجل دائمًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على الكسر</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مريم</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جمع منتهى الجموع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صفة فعلان</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علم مؤنث بالمعنى زائد على ثلاثة أحرف</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هند</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يجب البناء على الكسر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يمتنع الصرف في كل استعمال</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يجوز الصرف والمنع؛ المنع أصحّ</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "6G-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Use <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المنع</span></b> for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هند</span> in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سلّمتُ على <span class=\"blank\"></span></span></b>.", "sol": "<p>The selected <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منع</span> gives <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحة نيابة عن الكسرة</span> after <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">على. هندٍ</span> is valid under <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الصرف</span> but is not the requested treatment.</p>", "group": "6G|Guided", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هندَ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هندُ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هندٍ</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الصرف</span>"], "ans": 0}, {"id": "6I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Use <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الصرف</span></b> for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هند</span> in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تحدّثتُ إلى <span class=\"blank\"></span></span></b>.", "sol": "<p>Under <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الصرف, إلى</span> gives <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر بالكسرة</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين</span>. The exercise deliberately chooses the permitted alternative to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المنع</span>.</p>", "group": "6I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هندَ</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المنع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هندٍ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هندٌ</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "6I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Analyse <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لحذامِ</span></b> using the <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حجازي</span></b> treatment.", "sol": "<p>The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حجازي</span> account is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء على الكسر</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تميمي</span> account treats this <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عَلَم</span> as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غير منصرف معرب</span>; do not merge the two.</p>", "group": "6I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذام معرب مجرور بالفتحة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذام مبني على الكسر في محل جر باللام</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حذام منصوب بكسرة ظاهرة</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "6R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Choose the accurate statement about <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أسماء القبائل والأماكن</span>.", "sol": "<p>The examples include both <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منع</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صرف</span>, and sometimes both are recognised. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التأنيث</span> versus <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التذكير</span> helps explain the stated uses, but guessing a universal geographical rule does not.</p>", "group": "6R|Review", "opts": ["Their recognised usage matters; not all take one uniform treatment.", "Every place-name is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني</span>.", "Every tribe-name must be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصرف</span>."], "ans": 0}, {"id": "6-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">يجوز في هند الصرف والمنع، والمنع أصحّ</span>.</b> Which conclusion follows?", "sol": "<p>Preference does not cancel permission. The two analyses produce different visible <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر</span> endings, so questions name the selected one.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هند</span> must be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبنيًا</span> in both accounts.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هندٍ</span> is never valid because <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المنع أصحّ</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هندٍ</span> can be valid when <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الصرف</span> is selected."], "ans": 2}]}, {"key": "7", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العَلَم العجمي</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التركيب المزجي</span>", "short": "Lesson 7", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L7-s1\"><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العلمية والعجمة</span></h2><p>The <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عَلَم العجمي</span></b> qualifies when it has more than three letters, or is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ثلاثيًّا متحرّك الوسط</span> (the stated example is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سقر</span></b>). Do not omit the letter-count and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حركة شرط</span> and replace it with “every foreign-looking name.” A guess about spelling is not proof of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عجمة</span>.</p><p>The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شروط</span> can overlap: a name may also meet a rule already learned under <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العلمية والتأنيث</span>. In a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استفهام</span> asking for the cause studied here, select <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العلمية والعجمة</span></b>.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L7-s2\"><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العلمية والتركيب</span></h2><p>A <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مركّب تركيب مزج</span></b> combines components into one <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عَلَم</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بعلبكّ</span></b>. It is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غير منصرف</span> provided it is <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غير مختوم بويه</span></b>.</p><p>A name ending in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ويه</span></b>, such as <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سيبويه</span></b>, instead has <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء على الكسر</span></b> in the adopted account. Its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span> responds to the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عامل</span>; its final <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسر</span> does not change. Do not treat every multi-part name as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب مزجي</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عبد الله</span></b> has a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span> relationship.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L7-s3\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سَافَرَ إِبْرَاهِيمُ إِلَى بَعْلَبَكَّ</span>.</b> <span class=\"gl\">Ibrahim travelled to Baalbek.</span></div><ul><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سافر: فعل ماض مبني على الفتح</span>.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إبراهيمُ: فاعل مرفوع بالضمة بلا تنوين؛ غير منصرف للعلمية والعجمة</span>.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إلى: حرف جر؛ بعلبكَّ: اسم مجرور بإلى، وعلامة جرّه الفتحة نيابةً عن الكسرة؛ غير منصرف للعلمية والتركيب المزجي</span>.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إلى بعلبكّ: جار ومجرور متعلقان بسافر</span>.</li></ul><p>Compare <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرأتُ لسيبويهِ</span></b>: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سيبويه مبني على الكسر في محل جر باللام</span>. It does not belong to the same <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span> pattern as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بعلبكّ</span>.</p></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L7-s1", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العلمية والعجمة</span>"}, {"id": "L7-s2", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العلمية والتركيب</span>"}, {"id": "L7-s3", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "7G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Match each expression to the selected classification.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إبراهيم</span> combines <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العلمية والعجمة. بعلبكّ</span> meets the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب مزجي شرط</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ويه</span> ending sends <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سيبويه</span> to the adopted <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء</span> account.</p>", "group": "7G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إبراهيم</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على الكسر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علم عجمي زائد على ثلاثة أحرف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علم على وزن فعّال مع نون أصلية</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بعلبكّ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علم مركّب تركيب مزج غير مختوم بويه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علم مختوم بويه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صفة معدولة</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سيبويه</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جمع منتهى الجموع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرب مجرور بالفتحة دائمًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على الكسر في التحليل المعتمد</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "7G-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Complete <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سافر إبراهيم<span class=\"blank\"></span> إلى بعلبك<span class=\"blank\"></span></span></b>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إبراهيم</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع بالضمة</span> without <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين. إلى</span> governs <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بعلبكّ</span>, which takes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحة</span> for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر</span> because of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العلمية والتركيب المزجي</span>.</p>", "group": "7G|Guided", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إبراهيمَ؛ بعلبكُّ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إبراهيمُ؛ بعلبكَّ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إبراهيمٌ؛ بعلبكٍّ</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "7I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Analyse <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قرأتُ لسيبويهِ</span></b>.", "sol": "<p>The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لام</span> establishes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل جر</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسر</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء</span> in this name, not a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span> ending chosen by the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لام</span>.</p>", "group": "7I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سيبويه مجرور بكسرة إعراب لأنه منصرف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سيبويه فاعل مرفوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سيبويه مبني على الكسر في محل جر</span>"], "ans": 2}, {"id": "7I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Correct: “Any name made of more than one word is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مركّب مزجي</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غير منصرف</span>.”", "sol": "<p>Do not replace <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب المزج</span> with the broad idea of multiple parts. In <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عبد الله, عبد</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الله مضاف إليه</span>.</p>", "group": "7I|Independent", "opts": ["Every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مركّب</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على الكسر</span>.", "Correct: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عبد الله</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بعلبك</span> have identical structure.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عبد الله</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span>; the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مزجي</span> rule requires the specified kind of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>."], "ans": 2}, {"id": "7R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Compare <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ببعلبكَّ</span></b> and <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لسيبويهِ</span></b> in the adopted accounts.", "sol": "<p>Both follow <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر</span>, but one expresses <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر</span> through <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إعراب</span> and the other through <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محل</span>. The ending <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ويه</span> is a decisive <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span> here.</p>", "group": "7R|Review", "opts": ["Both are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوبان</span> because they lack <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بعلبك معرب مجرور بالفتحة؛ سيبويه مبني في محل جر</span>", "Both are <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبنيان</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "7-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غير مختوم بويه</span>.</b> What must you check?", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مختوم</span> identifies the end of the word. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سيبويه</span> fails this <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span> and is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني</span> in the account taught.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["The name must end in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ويه</span> to be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غير منصرف</span> by this rule.", "Every word with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">و</span> somewhere is excluded.", "The name must not end in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ويه</span> for this <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منع الصرف</span> rule."], "ans": 2}]}, {"key": "8", "title": "Returning <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسرة</span>, removing <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين</span>, and the full decision", "short": "Lesson 8", "html": "<h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L8-s1\"><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أل</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span></h2><p>A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غير منصرف</span> takes <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسرة في الجر</span></b> when it has <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أل</span></b> or is itself <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضافًا</span></b>:</p><table><thead><tr><th>Construction</th><th>Ending and reason</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مررتُ بمساجدَ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحة</span>: neither <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أل</span> nor <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مررتُ بالمساجدِ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسرة: أل</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مررتُ بمساجدِ المدينةِ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسرة: مساجد</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف</span></td></tr><tr><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مررتُ ببعضِ مساجدَ</span></td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مساجد</span> still takes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحة</span>: it is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>, not <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p>The return of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسرة</span> does not introduce <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين: أل</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span> themselves prevent it. In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">آمنّا بالأنبياءِ؛ آمنّا بأنبياءِ اللهِ</span></b>, explain the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسرة</span> through the actual construction.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L8-s2\">When <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العلمية</span> is removed</h2><p>If <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منع</span> depends on <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العلمية</span> and the name is used as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة</span>, that <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span> falls away. <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لكلّ فرعونٍ موسًى</span></b> uses the names as types: for every Pharaoh-like figure, a Musa-like figure. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فرعونٍ</span> now has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صرف</span>, and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">موسًى</span> shows <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين</span> with its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تقديري إعراب</span>.</p><p>This principle concerns a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منع</span> requiring <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العلمية</span>. It does not remove an independently sufficient cause such as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف التأنيث</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منتهى الجموع</span> merely because an expression is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرة</span>.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L8-s3\">No <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين</span> does not always mean <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منع</span></h2><p><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">آمنّا بمحمدِ بنِ عبدِ اللهِ</span></b> has no <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين</span> on <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محمد</span> in this <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ابن</span> construction, although <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محمد</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصرف</span>. Use the analysis <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ابن بدل</span></b> here. Do not give <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محمد جرًّا بالفتحة</span> merely because its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين</span> has dropped.</p><p>An established <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صرف للتناسب</span></b> also occurs: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سلاسلًا وأغلالًا وسعيرًا</span></b> in a recognised <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قراءة</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين</span> on <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سلاسلًا</span> is a stated special use for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التناسب</span>. It does not license adding <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين</span> to any <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منتهى الجموع</span> in ordinary exercises.</p><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L8-s4\">Put the nine <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أسباب</span> together</h2><table><thead><tr><th>How they operate</th><th><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أسباب</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>One cause stands for two</td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التأنيث بألف زائدة؛ مجموع منتهى الجموع</span></td></tr><tr><td>A qualifying <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الصفة</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العَلَم</span> combines with</td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وزن الفعل؛ الألف والنون الزائدتان؛ العدل</span></td></tr><tr><td>A qualifying <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العَلَم</span> combines with</td><td><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التأنيث؛ العجمة؛ التركيب</span></td></tr></tbody></table><p>The nine headings are <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التأنيث، الجمع منتهى الجموع، الصفة، العلم، وزن الفعل، الألف والنون الزائدتان، العدل، العجمة، التركيب</span></b>. In this discussion, <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العلمية</span> may also be called <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرفة</span></b> or <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تعريف</span></b>. That terminology does not make every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرفة غير منصرف</span>.</p><div class=\"worked\"><h2 class=\"sec\" id=\"L8-s5\">Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span></h2><div class=\"exm\"><b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صَلَّيْتُ فِي مَسَاجِدِ المَدِينَةِ</span>.</b> <span class=\"gl\">I prayed in the city’s mosques.</span></div><ul><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صلّيتُ: فعل ماض مبني على السكون؛ التاء ضمير في محل رفع فاعل</span>.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في: حرف جر</span>.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مساجدِ: اسم مجرور بفي، وعلامة جرّه الكسرة لأنه مضاف؛ وهو على صيغة منتهى الجموع</span>.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المدينةِ: مضاف إليه مجرور بالكسرة</span>.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في مساجد المدينة: جار ومجرور متعلقان بصلّيت</span>.</li></ul><p>For each new <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span>: identify <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العامل والموقع</span></b>; test <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرب أو مبني</span></b>; identify a qualifying <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سبب أو سببان</span></b>; check <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أل والإضافة</span></b>; then supply <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الإعراب وعلامته</span></b>.</p></div>", "secs": [{"id": "L8-s1", "title": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أل</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span>"}, {"id": "L8-s2", "title": "When <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العلمية</span> is removed"}, {"id": "L8-s3", "title": "No <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين</span> does not always mean <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منع</span>"}, {"id": "L8-s4", "title": "Put the nine <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أسباب</span> together"}, {"id": "L8-s5", "title": "Worked <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>"}], "items": [{"id": "8G-1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Choose the ending and immediate reason.", "sol": "<p>The bare <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منتهى الجموع</span> has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحة</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر. أل</span> or being <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف</span> restores <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسرة</span>, but neither allows <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين</span> in these constructions.</p>", "group": "8G|Guided", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في مساجد</span>, no <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أل</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مساجدَ: جر بالفتحة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مساجدُ: رفع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مساجدٍ: جر بالكسرة والتنوين</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في المساجد</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المساجدٍ: أل</span> permits <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المساجدَ: أل</span> never affects the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المساجدِ: جر بالكسرة لدخول أل</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في مساجد المدينة</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مساجدَ: إضافة</span> cannot affect it", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مساجدٍ: مضاف منوّن</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مساجدِ: جر بالكسرة لأنه مضاف</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "8G-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Complete <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مررتُ ببعضِ مساجد<span class=\"blank\"></span></span></b>. <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مساجد</span> has no <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أل</span> or following <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بعض</span> is the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مساجد</span> is only <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>. That position does not restore <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسرة</span>, so it remains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرورًا بالفتحة</span>.</p>", "group": "8G|Guided", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مساجدِ</span> because it is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مساجدَ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مساجدٍ</span>"], "ans": 1}, {"id": "8I-1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "In <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لكلّ فرعونٍ موسًى</span></b>, the names are used as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نكرتين</span> naming types. Why does <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فرعون</span> have <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين</span>?", "sol": "<p>This use removes the particular-name <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span>. It does not mean that <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلّ</span> can override any independent cause of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منع الصرف</span>.</p>", "group": "8I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كلّ</span> always makes every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم منصرفًا</span>.", "The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العلمية</span> needed for its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منع</span> has been removed.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فرعون</span> has become <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبنيًا</span>."], "ans": 1}, {"id": "8I-2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Correct: “<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محمد</span> in <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بمحمدِ بنِ عبدِ اللهِ</span></b> has no <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين</span>, so it must be <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غير منصرف</span>.”", "sol": "<p>The observed <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسرة</span> remains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جرّ الإعراب</span>. Absence of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين</span> can have a construction-specific cause other than <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منع الصرف</span>.</p>", "group": "8I|Independent", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محمد</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على الكسر</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محمد</span> remains <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصرفًا؛ التنوين</span> dropped in the stated <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ابن</span> construction.", "Correct: change it to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بمحمدَ</span>."], "ans": 1}, {"id": "8R", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Does the recognised reading <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سلاسلًا وأغلالًا وسعيرًا</span></b> permit adding <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين</span> to any <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منتهى الجموع</span> in an ordinary exercise?", "sol": "<p>A stated special reading is recognised on its own terms. It does not erase the ordinary rule for words such as <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصابيح</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مساجد</span>.</p>", "group": "8R|Review", "opts": ["No: it illustrates a specified <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صرف للتناسب</span>.", "Yes: every <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به</span> must have <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين</span>.", "Yes: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منتهى الجموع</span> never prevents <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الصرف</span>."], "ans": 0}, {"id": "8-Read", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كونه مضافًا لا مجرّد كونه مضافًا إليه</span>.</b> Which expression restores <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسرة</span> on <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مساجد</span> through <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span>?", "sol": "<p>In <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مساجد المدينة, مساجد</span> is itself <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف</span>. In <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بعض مساجد</span>, it is the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف إليه</span>, which does not supply the required <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span>.</p>", "group": "|Reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بمساجدَ</span> with no following addition", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ببعضِ مساجدَ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بمساجدِ المدينةِ</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"key": "R", "title": "Module review: apply <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غير المنصرف</span> in connected reading", "short": "Module review", "html": "<p>Predict each ending before looking at the choices. Explain the role, the cause and the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة</span> separately. Where a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">استفهام</span> selects a recognised treatment, keep that treatment throughout.</p>", "secs": [], "items": [{"id": "A1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Match each qualifying use to its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سبب أو سببان</span>.", "sol": "<p>Two causes suffice independently here: <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف التأنيث</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منتهى الجموع</span>. The other examples require their stated combinations and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شروط</span>.</p>", "group": "A|Conditions and classifications", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صحراء</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التركيب المزجي</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العلمية وحدها</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف التأنيث الممدودة</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصابيح</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجموع منتهى الجموع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الوصفية والعدل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العلمية والتأنيث</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحمر, أصلي في الوصف</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الجمع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العلمية والعجمة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الوصفية ووزن أفعل مع عدم قبول التاء</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عثمان</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العلمية والألف والنون الزائدتان</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الوصفية والعدل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التأنيث بالتاء</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بعلبكّ</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">البناء لوجود ويه</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الوصفية وحدها</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العلمية والتركيب المزجي</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "A2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "Which claim wrongly replaces a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span> with a guess?", "sol": "<p>Final <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ان</span> alone does not establish either the descriptive <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span> or the added-letter <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شرط</span> in a <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عَلَم. حسّان</span> demonstrates why origin matters.</p>", "group": "A|Conditions and classifications", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كل اسم آخره ان غير منصرف بلا فحص للأصل أو الاستعمال</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غضبان مؤنثه غضبى فيحقق الشرط المذكور</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حسّان من الحسن نونه أصلية في التحليل المحدّد</span>."], "ans": 0}, {"id": "B1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اختر الضبط بحسب الشرط المحدّد</span>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">هند</span> uses the chosen <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منع. حسّان</span> from <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الحسن</span> uses <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صرف. مصابيح</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف</span>, restoring <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسرة. أصفر</span> meets the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">وصفية شرط</span> and has <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحة</span> for <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر</span> in the specified form.</p>", "group": "B|Endings and correction", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">على هند: اختر المنع</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">على هندُ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">على هندَ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">على هندٍ</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إلى حسّان: من الحسن</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إلى حسّانٍ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إلى حسّانُ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إلى حسّانَ</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بمصابيح الغرفة</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بمصابيحَ الغرفةِ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بمصابيحِ الغرفةِ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بمصابيحٍ الغرفةِ</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عن أصفر: صفة بلا أل ولا إضافة</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عن أصفرُ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عن أصفرٍ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عن أصفرَ</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "B2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صحّح</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مررتُ برجلٍ غضبانَ؛ غضبان منصوب لأنه مفتوح الآخر</span>.</b>", "sol": "<p>It follows <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">رجل</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر</span>. Its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منع الصرف</span> explains the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحة</span>. A <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حركة</span> cannot identify the syntactic role independently of the relationship.</p>", "group": "B|Endings and correction", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غضبان مبني على الفتح لأنه نعت</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غضبان نعت مجرور بالفتحة نيابة عن الكسرة</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غضبان فاعل مرفوع</span>."], "ans": 1}, {"id": "C1", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Read: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">سافر إبراهيم إلى بعلبك. مرّ بمساجد قديمة. صلّى في مساجد المدينة</span>.</b> Restore the indicated endings.", "sol": "<p>Read <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إبراهيمُ، بعلبكَّ، بمساجدَ قديمةٍ، في مساجدِ المدينةِ</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير المستتر هو</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مرّ</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صلّى</span> returns to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إبراهيم. قديمة</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصرف</span> and takes <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسرة</span> despite the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحة</span> on its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منعوت. إضافة</span> in the last <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة</span> restores <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسرة</span> on <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مساجد</span>.</p>", "group": "C|Connected reading and full تركيب", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إبراهيم</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إبراهيمَ: مفعول به</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إبراهيمُ: فاعل بلا تنوين</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إبراهيمٌ: فاعل منصرف</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بعلبك</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بعلبكَّ: مجرور بالفتحة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بعلبكٍّ: مجرور بالكسرة والتنوين</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بعلبكُّ: خبر</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بمساجد</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بمساجدُ: مرفوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بمساجدٍ: كل جمع منصرف</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بمساجدَ: منتهى الجموع بلا أل أو إضافة</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قديمة</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قديمةٌ: فاعل مرّ</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قديمةَ: يجب نسخ الفتحة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">قديمةٍ: نعت مجرور بالكسرة</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في مساجد المدينة</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مساجدَ لأن الإضافة تمنع الكسرة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مساجدٍ مع التنوين</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مساجدِ لأنه مضاف؛ المدينةِ مضاف إليه</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "C2", "type": "grid", "prompt": "Full <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تركيب</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتبَ عمرُ إلى عثمانَ</span>.</b>", "sol": "<p>The roles come from <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتب</span> and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إلى. العلمية والعدل</span> explain absence of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين</span> on <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عمر</span>; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العلمية والألف والنون</span> explain the special <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر علامة</span> on <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عثمان</span>. Both names remain <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معربين</span>.</p>", "group": "C|Connected reading and full تركيب", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كتب</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض مبني على الفتح</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مرفوع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضارع مجزوم</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عمر</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول به منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مرفوع بالضمة؛ غير منصرف للعلمية والعدل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل مبني على الضم</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إلى</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم في محل رفع</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر لا محل له</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف نصب للفعل</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">عثمان</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مجرور بفتحة نيابة عن الكسرة؛ للعلمية والألف والنون الزائدتين</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصوب بإلى</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على الفتح</span>"], "ans": 0}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إلى عثمان</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جار ومجرور متعلقان بكتب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مضاف ومضاف إليه بلا حرف جر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة في محل رفع فاعل</span>"], "ans": 0}]}]}, {"id": "C3", "type": "grid", "prompt": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حلّل الجملة كاملة</span>: <b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صلّيتُ في المساجدِ</span>.</b>", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المساجد</span> retains the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منتهى الجموع</span> form, but <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أل</span> restores <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسرة</span> in <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر</span>. It has no <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين</span> because of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أل</span>. The <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل</span> and attached <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فاعل</span> form the main structure; <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في المساجد</span> relates to <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صلّيت</span>.</p>", "group": "C|Connected reading and full تركيب", "cols": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التحليل</span>"], "rows": [{"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">صلّيت</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل مضارع منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فعل ماض مبني على السكون لاتصاله بتاء الفاعل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم فعل لا محل له</span>"], "ans": 1}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التاء</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تاء تأنيث لا محل لها</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير في محل جر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ضمير مبني على الضم في محل رفع فاعل</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم ظرف منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف يرفع الاسم</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">حرف جر لا محل له</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">المساجد</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني على الكسر</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مجرور بالفتحة رغم أل</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اسم مجرور بالكسرة لدخول أل</span>"], "ans": 2}]}, {"label": "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">في المساجد</span>", "cells": [{"opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جملة فعلية مستقلة</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مفعول مطلق منصوب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جار ومجرور متعلقان بصلّيت</span>"], "ans": 2}]}]}, {"id": "D1", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">التأنيث بألف زائدة يقوم مقام السببين</span>.</b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اختر النتيجة</span>.", "sol": "<p>The statement specifically concerns <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف التأنيث الزائدة</span>. It is sufficient independently; it must not be widened to every kind of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تأنيث</span> or every final <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف</span>.</p>", "group": "D|Arabic grammatical reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كل اسم مؤنث المعنى وحده غير منصرف</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">ألف هدى الثالثة تمنع الصرف</span>.", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا تشترط العلمية لمنع صحراء من الصرف</span>."], "ans": 2}, {"id": "D2", "type": "mcq", "prompt": "<b><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">لا يستلزم سقوط التنوين منع الصرف</span>.</b> <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">اختر الدليل</span>.", "sol": "<p><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محمد</span> is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">منصرف</span> despite loss of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين</span> in this construction, and its <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسرة</span> expresses <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر</span>. The other choices wrongly equate absence of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">بناء</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">فتحة</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span>.</p>", "group": "D|Arabic grammatical reading", "opts": ["<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أحمدَ لأنه لا يكون إلا مبنيًا</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مصابيحَ لأن كل فتحة علامة نصب</span>", "<span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">محمدِ في بمحمدِ بنِ عبدِ اللهِ</span>"], "ans": 2}], "after": "<h2 class=\"sec\">Ready to continue?</h2><p>You should be able to explain why a word is <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">غير منصرف</span>, distinguish <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">جر بالفتحة</span> from <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">نصب</span>, apply the <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شروط</span> on <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الصفة والعلم</span>, recognise permitted alternatives, and restore <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">كسرة</span> with <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أل</span> or <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">إضافة</span>. Do not treat absence of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين</span> as sufficient evidence on its own.</p>"}], "revisit": "<ul><li>Role versus <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">علامة</span>, and <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">معرب</span> versus <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">مبني</span>: Lesson 1.</li><li>Causes sufficient by themselves: Lessons 2–3.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">شروط</span> on <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">الصفة</span>: Lesson 4.</li><li>Causes requiring <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العلمية</span> and recognised alternatives: Lessons 5–7.</li><li><span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">أل والإضافة</span>, loss of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">العلمية</span> and absence of <span class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" dir=\"rtl\">تنوين</span>: Lesson 8.</li></ul>"};
